# GridQ environment — example
#
# NONE of these are required for the v1 MVP. The deterministic core + mock engine
# run with no external services. Copy to .env only when you need the optional bits.
# Never commit a real .env or real secrets. See docs/02_architecture.md §8.

# Local file-based storage for SiteModels / quote records (default: ./data)
# GRIDQ_DATA_DIR=./data

# Pin the active assumption-library version (default: latest under src/gridq/assumptions)
# GRIDQ_ASSUMPTION_VERSION=

# --- Future / non-MVP perimeter integrations (leave unset for v1) ---

# Creditsafe API — real counterparty credit feed (M9). v1 uses a manual/stub mapping.
# CREDITSAFE_API_KEY=

# LLM provider for the AGENTIC PERIMETER only (ingestion assist, document drafting).
# It must never touch a number on the pricing path. See CLAUDE.md / architecture §1.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
